Name Rio Note - News #1 Cup Threat

Interactability_Text_Line_0 World Paper News
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 International Cup set to happen in July despite epidemic fears.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Yesterday, February 2nd, the Federation for International Football Councils has stated that the International Cup is set to take place as usual this July, in Russia, despite growing fears of a spreading epidemic in the Northern Hemisphere.